"<div class=\"md-block\"><div class=\"md-block-head\">図<span class=\"md-sp\"><button class=\"md-btn md-btn-sm\" data-act=\"addFigTo\" data-arg=\"{0}\" data-tip=\"別の種類の図をもう 1 つ足します。\">＋ 図を追加</button></span></div><div class=\"md-block-body\">" = "<div class=\"md-block\"><div class=\"md-block-head\">Figures<span class=\"md-sp\"><button class=\"md-btn md-btn-sm\" data-act=\"addFigTo\" data-arg=\"{0}\" data-tip=\"Adds another figure of a different type.\">＋ Add figure</button></span></div><div class=\"md-block-body\">",
"<div class=\"md-block\"><div class=\"md-block-head\">報告書の文（定型文）<span class=\"md-sp\">{0}<button class=\"md-btn md-btn-sm\" data-act=\"textCopyAt\" data-arg=\"{1}\">コピー</button></span></div><div class=\"md-block-body\">" = "<div class=\"md-block\"><div class=\"md-block-head\">Report text (standard text)<span class=\"md-sp\">{0}<button class=\"md-btn md-btn-sm\" data-act=\"textCopyAt\" data-arg=\"{1}\">Copy</button></span></div><div class=\"md-block-body\">",
"<div class=\"md-block\"><div class=\"md-block-head\">表<span class=\"md-sp\"><button class=\"md-btn md-btn-sm\" data-act=\"tblCopyAt\" data-arg=\"{0}\" data-tip=\"デザインごとコピーします。Excel や Word に貼り付けられます。\">コピー</button><button class=\"md-btn md-btn-sm\" data-act=\"tblCsvAt\" data-arg=\"{1}\">CSV で保存</button></span></div><div class=\"md-block-body md-tables\" data-tables=\"" = "<div class=\"md-block\"><div class=\"md-block-head\">Table<span class=\"md-sp\"><button class=\"md-btn md-btn-sm\" data-act=\"tblCopyAt\" data-arg=\"{0}\" data-tip=\"Copies with the design. You can paste it into Excel or Word.\">Copy</button><button class=\"md-btn md-btn-sm\" data-act=\"tblCsvAt\" data-arg=\"{1}\">Save as CSV</button></span></div><div class=\"md-block-body md-tables\" data-tables=\"",
"<div class=\"md-cp-t\">テーマの色</div>{0}<div class=\"md-cp-t\">白〜黒</div>{1}<div class=\"md-cp-t\">論文誌風の色</div>{2}<div class=\"md-cp-t\">色覚に配慮した色</div>{3}<label class=\"md-check\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">その他の色… <input type=\"color\" id=\"md_cp_other\" style=\"width:44px;height:24px;padding:0;border:1px solid var(--t-c6e0cf)\"></label>" = "<div class=\"md-cp-t\">Theme colors</div>{0}<div class=\"md-cp-t\">White to black</div>{1}<div class=\"md-cp-t\">Journal-style colors</div>{2}<div class=\"md-cp-t\">Colorblind-friendly colors</div>{3}<label class=\"md-check\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">More colors… <input type=\"color\" id=\"md_cp_other\" style=\"width:44px;height:24px;padding:0;border:1px solid var(--t-c6e0cf)\"></label>",
"<div class=\"md-empty\">保存したプロジェクトはまだありません。「上書き保存」で保存すると、ここに並びます。</div>" = "<div class=\"md-empty\">No saved projects yet. Projects saved with “Save” appear here.</div>",
"<div class=\"md-empty\">当てはまる解析がありません。別のことばで探してください。</div>" = "<div class=\"md-empty\">No matching analyses. Try different words.</div>",
"<div class=\"md-empty\">計算しています。</div>" = "<div class=\"md-empty\">Calculating.</div>",
"<div class=\"md-fh md-fh-e\" data-h=\"e\" data-tip=\"ドラッグで幅を変えます。\"></div><div class=\"md-fh md-fh-s\" data-h=\"s\" data-tip=\"ドラッグで高さを変えます。\"></div><div class=\"md-fh md-fh-se\" data-h=\"se\" data-tip=\"ドラッグで大きさを変えます。\"></div></div></div>" = "<div class=\"md-fh md-fh-e\" data-h=\"e\" data-tip=\"Drag to change the width.\"></div><div class=\"md-fh md-fh-s\" data-h=\"s\" data-tip=\"Drag to change the height.\"></div><div class=\"md-fh md-fh-se\" data-h=\"se\" data-tip=\"Drag to resize.\"></div></div></div>",
"<div class=\"md-figrow\"><div class=\"md-figcap\">図 " = "<div class=\"md-figrow\"><div class=\"md-figcap\">Figure ",
"<div class=\"md-grid2\"><label class=\"md-field\">名前<input type=\"text\" id=\"md_sc_name\" value=\"{0}\"></label><div class=\"md-field\">計算<div class=\"md-row\" style=\"gap:12px;margin-top:4px\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"md_sc_m\" value=\"mean\"{1}> 平均点</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"md_sc_m\" value=\"sum\"{2}> 合計点</label></div></div></div><p class=\"md-hint\" style=\"margin:6px 0\">尺度に含める項目に ☑ を付けます。逆の向きに聞いた項目（例：「海は好きではない」）には「逆転」を付けると、点数を反対にしてから計算します。すべての項目に答えた人だけ得点を出し、1 つでも答えていない人は欠損にします。平均点は、項目の数が違う尺度どうしでも比べやすくなります。</p><div style=\"max-height:46vh;overflow:auto;border:1px solid var(--t-d5e3da)\"><table class=\"md-t0\" style=\"width:100%;table-layout:fixed\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:44px\"><col><col style=\"width:64px\"><col style=\"width:70px\"></colgroup><tr><th class=\"md-rh\">使う</th><th class=\"md-rh\">項目</th><th class=\"md-rh\">段階</th><th class=\"md-rh\">向き</th></tr>" = "<div class=\"md-grid2\"><label class=\"md-field\"Name<input type=\"text\" id=\"md_sc_name\" value=\"{0}\"></label><div class=\"md-field\"Calculation<div class=\"md-row\" style=\"gap:12px;margin-top:4px\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"md_sc_m\" value=\"mean\"{1} Mean score</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"md_sc_m\" value=\"sum\"{2} Total score</label></div></div></div><p class=\"md-hint\" style=\"margin:6px 0\">Check ☑ for the items to include in the scale. For items worded in the opposite direction (e.g., “I do not like the ocean”), check “Reverse” to reverse their scores before calculation. Scores are given only to respondents who answered all items; anyone who skipped an item is missing. The mean score makes scales with different numbers of items easier to compare.</p><div style=\"max-height:46vh;overflow:auto;border:1px solid var(--t-d5e3da)\"><table class=\"md-t0\" style=\"width:100%;table-layout:fixed\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:44px\"><col><col style=\"width:64px\"><col style=\"width:70px\"></colgroup><tr><th class=\"md-rh\"Use</th><th class=\"md-rh\"Item</th><th class=\"md-rh\"Levels</th><th class=\"md-rh\"Direction</th></tr>",
"<div class=\"md-hint\" style=\"color:var(--t-1e2f26)\">・図：「解析の名前_図1.png」のように、解析ごとに 1 から番号を付けます。画面に出ている形と大きさのままです。<br>・Excel ファイル：CSV をシートにし、その右側に Excel の関数で解析を再現します（値の貼り付けはしません）。<br>・R のコード：解析を R の標準の関数で計算し直すスクリプトと、そのデータです。<br>・報告書：すべての解析の文と表を、PDF・Word・テキストのいずれかにまとめます。</div>" = "<div class=\"md-hint\" style=\"color:var(--t-1e2f26)\">• Figures: numbered from 1 for each analysis, like “analysis name_Fig1.png”, with the shape and size shown on screen.<br>• Excel file: the CSV as a sheet, with the analyses reproduced to its right using Excel functions (no pasted values).<br>• R code: a script that recalculates the analyses with standard R functions, and its data.<br>• Report: the text and tables of all analyses as PDF, Word or text.</div>",
"<div class=\"md-hint\" style=\"margin:0\">図はありません。「＋ 図を追加」で足せます。</div>" = "<div class=\"md-hint\" style=\"margin:0\">No figures. Add one with “＋ Add figure”.</div>",
"<div class=\"md-hint\" style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-ui)\">開いているプロジェクトの設定</div>" = "<div class=\"md-hint\" style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-ui)\">Settings of the open project</div>",
"<div class=\"md-hint\" style=\"margin:6px 0 0\">比べる設問をもう 1 つ以上選んでください。◎ は、選んだ設問と同じ選択肢の設問です。</div>" = "<div class=\"md-hint\" style=\"margin:6px 0 0\">Select at least one more question to compare. ◎ marks questions with the same options as the selected question.</div>",
"<div class=\"md-hint\" style=\"margin:8px 0 0\">カスタム設定の中身{0}</div>{1}<div class=\"md-row\" style=\"gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:6px\"><button class=\"md-btn\" data-act=\"customSave\" data-tip=\"開いている画面の設定と、選んでいる図・表の書式（字体・大きさなども含む）を、まとめてカスタム設定にします。\">今の設定と図・表の書式をまとめて取り込む</button><button class=\"md-btn\" data-act=\"customApply\"{2}>開いているプロジェクトに当てはめる</button></div><div class=\"md-row\" style=\"gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:6px\"><button class=\"md-btn\" data-act=\"customExport\"{3}>書き出す</button><button class=\"md-btn\" data-act=\"customImport\">読み込む</button><button class=\"md-btn\" data-act=\"customDelete\"{4}>消す</button></div>" = "<div class=\"md-hint\" style=\"margin:8px 0 0\">Custom settings{0}</div>{1}<div class=\"md-row\" style=\"gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:6px\"><button class=\"md-btn\" data-act=\"customSave\" data-tip=\"Saves the current settings and the format of the selected figure and table (including fonts and sizes) as custom settings.\">Capture current settings and formats</button><button class=\"md-btn\" data-act=\"customApply\"{2}>Apply to the open project</button></div><div class=\"md-row\" style=\"gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:6px\"><button class=\"md-btn\" data-act=\"customExport\"{3}>Export</button><button class=\"md-btn\" data-act=\"customImport\">Import</button><button class=\"md-btn\" data-act=\"customDelete\"{4}>Delete</button></div>",
"<div class=\"md-lock-box\"><img src=\"icons/icon-192.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"><h1>公開を終了しました</h1><p>" = "<div class=\"md-lock-box\"><img src=\"icons/icon-192.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"><h1>This app is no longer available</h1><p>",
"<div class=\"md-numfix\">直した {0} 件・読めない {1} 件{2} <button class=\"md-btn md-btn-sm\" data-act=\"numClean\" data-arg=\"{3}\">確かめる</button>" = "<div class=\"md-numfix\">{0} corrected, {1} unreadable{2} <button class=\"md-btn md-btn-sm\" data-act=\"numClean\" data-arg=\"{3}\">Check</button>",
"<div class=\"md-orig\">元の回答：" = "<div class=\"md-orig\">Original response: ",
"<div class=\"md-page md-wide\"><table class=\"md-vars\"><thead><tr><th>列</th><th style=\"min-width:300px\">表示名（図・表・報告書に使う名前）</th><th>質問文</th><th style=\"min-width:150px\">種類</th><th>回答数</th><th>選択肢</th></tr></thead><tbody>" = "<div class=\"md-page md-wide\"><table class=\"md-vars\"><thead><tr><th>Column</th><th style=\"min-width:300px\">Display name (used in figures, tables and reports)</th><th>Question text</th><th style=\"min-width:150px\">Type</th><th>Responses</th><th>Options</th></tr></thead><tbody>",
"<div class=\"md-page\"><div class=\"md-block\"><div class=\"md-empty\"><b>データを読み込みました（回答 {0} 件、{1} 列）</b><br>{2}として読み取りました。<button class=\"md-link\" data-view=\"data\">列の読み取り方を確かめる</button><br><br><button class=\"md-btn md-btn-primary\" data-act=\"newAnalysis\">解析を始める</button><br><br>解析の種類を選ぶと、この画面に解析の欄ができます。その欄で設問を選ぶと、すぐに結果が出ます。<br>解析を足すと、この画面の下へ順に並びます。見出しの ∨ で畳めます。</div></div></div>" = "<div class=\"md-page\"><div class=\"md-block\"><div class=\"md-empty\"><b>Data loaded ({0} responses, {1} columns)</b><br>Detected column types: {2}. <button class=\"md-link\" data-view=\"data\">Check how the columns were read</button><br><br><button class=\"md-btn md-btn-primary\" data-act=\"newAnalysis\">Start analysis</button><br><br>Choose an analysis type to add an analysis section to this screen. Select questions in that section and the results appear immediately.<br>New analyses are added below in order. Collapse them with ∨ in the heading.</div></div></div>",
"<div class=\"md-projlist\"><div class=\"md-sec-title\">保存したプロジェクト</div>" = "<div class=\"md-projlist\"><div class=\"md-sec-title\">Saved projects</div>",
