"a〜d は 2×2 の表の左上・右上・左下・右下の人数です。共通オッズ比の信頼区間とブレスロー・デイ検定は Excel では再現していません。" = "a–d are the counts in the top-left, top-right, bottom-left and bottom-right cells of the 2×2 table. The confidence interval of the common odds ratio and the Breslow–Day test are not reproduced in Excel. ",
"chisq.test（2×2 の表でも補正なしが初期設定。イェーツの補正を選べる）。効果量は Cramér の V（2×2 では φ）。調整済み標準化残差でセルごとの多い・少ないを判定。" = "chisq.test (no correction by default, even for 2×2 tables; Yates' correction is optional). Effect size: Cramér's V (φ for 2×2). Cells that are higher or lower than expected are identified by adjusted standardized residuals. ",
"cor.test(method = \"pearson\")。95% 信頼区間はフィッシャーの z 変換による。散布図に回帰直線（lm）を引く。" = "cor.test(method = \"pearson\"). The 95% CI uses Fisher's z transformation. A regression line (lm) is drawn on the scatter plot. ",
"cor.test(method = \"spearman\")。" = "cor.test(method = \"spearman\"). ",
"d[[\"%d_数値\"]] <- ifelse(complete.cases(sc), %s(sc), NA)" = "d[[\"%d_num\"]] <- ifelse(complete.cases(sc), %s(sc), NA)",
"fisher.test。2×2 の表では条件付き最尤推定のオッズ比と 95% 信頼区間。表が大きく正確な計算が難しいときは、モンテカルロ法（20 万回）に自動で切り替え。" = "fisher.test. For 2×2 tables, the conditional maximum likelihood odds ratio and its 95% CI. When the table is too large for exact calculation, it switches automatically to a Monte Carlo estimate (200,000 replicates). ",
"glm(family = binomial)。B、標準誤差、Wald 検定、オッズ比と Wald 法の 95% 信頼区間、VIF。尤度比検定、Cox-Snell と Nagelkerke の R²、AIC、的中率（予測確率 0.5 で判定）。" = "glm(family = binomial). B, SE, Wald test, odds ratios with Wald 95% CIs, and VIF. Likelihood-ratio test, Cox–Snell and Nagelkerke R², AIC, and classification accuracy (predicted probability cut-off 0.5). ",
"kruskal.test。効果量 ε² = H / (N − 1)。多重比較は pairwise.wilcox.test（ホルム法）。" = "kruskal.test. Effect size ε² = H / (N − 1). Multiple comparisons with pairwise.wilcox.test (Holm method). ",
"lm（強制投入法）。偏回帰係数 B、標準誤差、標準化係数 β、95% 信頼区間、t、p、VIF。R²、調整済み R²、F 検定。単一回答は先頭の選択肢を基準にしたダミー変数、順序のある回答は段階の得点。" = "lm (forced entry). Partial regression coefficients B, SE, standardized coefficients β, 95% CI, t, p and VIF. R², adjusted R² and F test. Single-choice variables are dummy-coded with the first option as the reference; ordinal responses use level scores. ",
"mantelhaen.test（連続性の補正なし。3×2 以上の表では一般化した CMH 検定）。層ごとの chisq.test。2×2 の表では共通オッズ比（マンテル・ヘンツェル）と 95% 信頼区間、ブレスロー・デイ検定（タロンの補正）。" = "mantelhaen.test (no continuity correction; the generalized CMH test for tables larger than 2×2). chisq.test by stratum. For 2×2 tables, the common odds ratio (Mantel–Haenszel) with its 95% CI, and the Breslow–Day test (Tarone's correction). ",
